{
  "name": "MiroMiro: images, Elementor, whole page as code, AI agent",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "t",
      "name": "Run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        304
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Download every image from a website\nAll images on the page, fetched and zipped into one file. Change the URL in **Extract Images**.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Get a free MiroMiro API key (300 credits a month, no card): https://miromiro.app/api/onboarding\n2. Open any MiroMiro node > Credential > Create new, paste the key.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 1100,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a",
      "name": "Note a",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        192,
        -48
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "images",
        "url": "https://www.allbirds.com",
        "options": {},
        "requestOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "a1",
      "name": "List the images on the page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-miromiro.miroMiro",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        64
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "miroMiroApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "MiroMiro API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// MiroMiro returns every image URL on the page. Keep the first 40.\nreturn ($input.first().json.images || []).slice(0, 40).map((img, i) => ({ json: { url: img.url || img.src || img }, pairedItem: { item: 0 } }))"
      },
      "id": "a2",
      "name": "Split: one item per image",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        64
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "a3",
      "name": "Download each image",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [
        720,
        64
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Put every downloaded image on one item so they land in one zip.\nconst binary = {}\n$input.all().forEach((item, i) => { if (item.binary?.data) binary['image_' + String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')] = item.binary.data })\nreturn [{ json: { images: Object.keys(binary).length }, binary, pairedItem: { item: 0 } }]"
      },
      "id": "a4",
      "name": "Put all images together",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        64
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "compress",
        "binaryPropertyName": "={{ Object.keys($binary).join(\",\") }}",
        "fileName": "={{ String($('List the images on the page').first().json.url || 'website').split('/')[2].replace(/^www./, '') }}-images.zip"
      },
      "id": "a5",
      "name": "Zip the images",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.compression",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1184,
        64
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Turn a section into an Elementor template\nImport the .json in WordPress: Templates > Saved Templates > Import.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 1100,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "b",
      "name": "Note b",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        192,
        272
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://stripe.com",
        "framework": "elementor",
        "codeOptions": {},
        "requestOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "b1",
      "name": "Turn the hero into Elementor",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-miromiro.miroMiro",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        368
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "miroMiroApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "MiroMiro API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "toText",
        "sourceProperty": "code",
        "options": {
          "fileName": "={{ String($json.url || 'website').split('/')[2].replace(/^www./, '') }}-elementor.json"
        }
      },
      "id": "b2",
      "name": "Save the template as .json",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        480,
        368
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Rebuild a whole page as code\nEvery section of the page, rebuilt in a real browser and assembled. Open pagePreviewUrl to see it.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 1100,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "c",
      "name": "Note c",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        192,
        544
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://linear.app",
        "codeOptions": {},
        "requestOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "c1",
      "name": "Turn the hero into code + find sections",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-miromiro.miroMiro",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        640
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "miroMiroApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "MiroMiro API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// The first result lists every other section on the page, with a ready selector.\nconst first = $input.first().json\nreturn (first.sections || []).filter(s => s.selector !== first.selector)\n  .sort((a, b) => a.order - b.order).slice(0, 12)\n  .map(s => ({ json: { url: first.url || 'https://linear.app', selector: s.selector, section: s.label }, pairedItem: { item: 0 } }))"
      },
      "id": "c2",
      "name": "Split: one item per section",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        640
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "codeOptions": {
          "selector": "={{ $json.selector }}"
        },
        "requestOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "c3",
      "name": "Turn each section into code",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-miromiro.miroMiro",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        720,
        640
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "miroMiroApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "MiroMiro API"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Each section files itself under the page; the newest link has them all.\nconst all = [...$('Turn the hero into code + find sections').all(), ...$input.all()].map(i => i.json)\nconst page = all.filter(r => r.pagePreviewUrl).pop()?.pagePreviewUrl\nreturn [{ json: { pagePreviewUrl: page, sections: all.filter(r => r.code).length }, pairedItem: { item: 0 } }]"
      },
      "id": "c4",
      "name": "Get the whole-page link",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        640
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nd",
      "name": "Note d",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        880
