      "parameters": {
        "width": 1100,
        "height": 480,
        "color": 3,
        "content": "## 4. Use MiroMiro as an AI agent tool\nClick **Open chat** and ask: *Turn the hero of linear.app into a React component* or *What are the brand colors and fonts of airbnb.com?*\n\nAdd your chat model credential (Anthropic here; swap in OpenAI or Gemini if you prefer)."
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ag-c1",
      "name": "Chat",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        1000
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You help people rebuild websites. When the user names a website, use MiroMiro: \"MiroMiro brand\" for its brand colors, fonts and logo, \"MiroMiro code\" to turn a section of it into a React component. Return the code exactly as the tool gives it, then add the previewUrl so they can see it rendered."
        }
      },
      "id": "ag-a1",
      "name": "AI agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        520,
